00:35:34.737 --> 00:35:36.597
The vector is something opposite.

449
00:35:36.687 --> 00:35:41.292
So the vectors are actually equations that are mathematically generated points and

450
00:35:41.367 --> 00:35:44.337
shapes and paths, and they look like this.

451
00:35:44.427 --> 00:35:47.067
So the more you zoom in, nothing changes.

